{"name": "Pets Survivors", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315670/extras_big/6912ed00f8395a619be25360f2c83594.webp?t=1780320972\" height=\"293\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315670/extras/6912ed00f8395a619be25360f2c83594.avif?t=1780320972\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><strong>Pets Survivors</strong> is a survival roguelike inspired by the horde survival genre. Face endless waves of enemies, defeat monsters to gain experience, and level up during each run.<br/>With every level, choose between upgrading your weapon, special ability, or Pet, creating unique combinations in every playthrough.<br/>Each run offers different builds and playstyles, allowing you to experiment with strategies and discover powerful synergies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive by shooting and using your abilities!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315670/extras/cd8780599fd3fe80b76cfff858ab4fe3.poster.avif?t=1780320972\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315670/extras/cd8780599fd3fe80b76cfff858ab4fe3.webm?t=1780320972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315670/extras/cd8780599fd3fe80b76cfff858ab4fe3.mp4?t=1780320972\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple Pets and Weapons to choose from and unlock</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4315670/extras/1bbc7aa2d4e88b9